      110.02,
      560.13,
      479.56,
      573.27
    ],
    "text": "Practice of Electrician and Registration of Qualified Electricians as Engineering Technicians",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      49.01,
      583.13,
      543.07,
      607.27
    ],
    "text": "2. With effect from January 01,2026 and continuing until December 31, 2029, it is mandatory for individuals who practice as Electricians to possess a minimum qualification of National Vocational Qualification (NVQ) Level 3.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      49.01,
      616.13,
      543.07,
      629.27
    ],
    "text": "3. Commencing from January 01, 2030 onwards, the minimum qualification required for the practice of Electrician, an",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      64.03,
      627.13,
      274.32,
      640.27
    ],
